> # la diLIT.syftver.LImitid. ku cu selstuzi le myskva be cu tcadu le rukgu'e
>
> "tv", "kv" and "kg" are not valid consonant clusters, because the first
> consonant is voiced and the second unvoiced.

{syftver} should be {softuer}. {le myskva} is wrong; you want a cmene, {la 
moskuas} or something like that. {le rukgu'e} should be {le rukygu'e} or {la 
rukygug}.

{fy.sy.py.panocino} needs only one pause (the one after "py") by the canonical 
rules, and by both valfendi and camxes it doesn't need any because the only 
words after the lervla are CV cmavo.

